  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "To simulate cloth physics correctly, same as Dynamic Bone, Cloth Component need Capsule or Sphere colliders to not clip through the objects. However, when I added those colliders, everything was fine until I stepped on uneven or elevated surface in VRChat, which caused me to get turned around and sent flying across the room. Same happened when I would go up and down the stairs in any world. Switching between 2.0 and Avatar 3.0 didn't help. The problem was only solved when the colliders where removed. Please, fix it.",
